Licensed under the MIT license; see LICENSES/MIT.txt.

This is a collection of components with separate licenses:
- Kernel patch collection: GPL-2.0-only; existing per-file notices, dual-license
  choices and syscall exceptions remain in the patches and upstream sources.
- Omarchy packaging and documentation: MIT; see packaging/kernel/COPYING.omarchy.
- libcamera changes: GPL-2.0-or-later for cam, LGPL-2.1-or-later for the core
  pipeline. Upstream source retains its COPYING.rst, LICENSES and file notices.
- PipeWire GStreamer bridge: MIT; see vendor/pipewire-gst/COPYING and file notices.

MIT does not apply to the kernel or libcamera patches or to external firmware,
program banks or extracted tuning data. Those external inputs are not included.
See docs/PROVENANCE.md and REUSE.toml for the source boundaries.
